MAIN
MOVE TEMP 14 12
MOVE TEMP 15 HALLOCATE TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 4
MOVE TEMP 17 HALLOCATE TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 B_funA
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 0
MOVE TEMP 20 TEMP 19
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 0
MOVE TEMP 22 TEMP 21
HSTORE TEMP 3 8 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 3
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 5 0
MOVE TEMP 24 5
MOVE TEMP 25 CALL TEMP 6 ( TEMP 2 TEMP 24 )
PRINT TEMP 25
END
A_funA [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 26 20
MOVE TEMP 27 TEMP 26
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 27
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 28 10
MOVE TEMP 29 PLUS TEMP 7 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 30 TEMP 29
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 30
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 0 4
PRINT TEMP 8
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 4

RETURN TEMP 9
END
B_funA [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 31 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 8 TEMP 31
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 0 4
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 0 8
MOVE TEMP 32 PLUS TEMP 10 TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 33 TEMP 32
HSTORE TEMP 0 8 TEMP 33
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 0 8
PRINT TEMP 12
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 0 8

RETURN TEMP 13
END

